WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:09.516
On April 23rd,

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:13.019
Prince William and his wife Kate have welcomed their third child.

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:14.742
Louis Arthur Charles,

00:00:15.183 --> 00:00:19.726
a boy weighing 3.8 kilograms, fifth in line to the throne.

00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:25.245
Very happy, delighted, thank you. Three, three times more worried now.

00:00:25.914 --> 00:00:30.992
On May 19th, his brother, Prince Harry, will marry his fiancée Meghan Markle.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.898
This rather unexpected marriage,

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.249
It's wonderful, it's a surprise, let's go, at full speed.

00:00:37.695 --> 00:00:38.975
By finding love,

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:42.454
The two princes seem to have never been happier than they are today.

00:00:42.838 --> 00:00:44.836
We cherish them, William and Harry.

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:47.156
They are part of our daily lives.

00:00:47.197 --> 00:00:52.018
They were determined to make their private lives a success, and to make their upcoming marriage a success.

00:00:53.002 --> 00:00:56.065
This is how this monarchy feeds and perpetuates itself.

00:00:57.377 --> 00:01:01.033
Who is Meghan Markle and how did she meet Harry?

00:01:01.658 --> 00:01:04.299
Please welcome the lovely Meghan Markle.

00:01:04.361 --> 00:01:08.403
How did this American woman, a commoner, divorced, and of mixed race,

00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:11.188
Did she convince the queen to allow their marriage?

00:01:11.569 --> 00:01:17.493
She is anything but the young girl who was raised to one day become the companion of one of the princes of England, quite the contrary.

00:01:17.572 --> 00:01:21.478
She is a woman who sets an example of something that I believe is very important.

00:01:21.596 --> 00:01:25.766
Today, the barriers and boundaries of love go beyond everything.

00:01:27.344 --> 00:01:29.218
When you love, you can.

00:01:29.549 --> 00:01:31.001
And she succeeded.

00:01:31.814 --> 00:01:34.611
Why are people already saying that Kate and Meghan hate each other?

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:36.998
Are they pretending to like each other?

00:01:37.912 --> 00:01:41.956
Kate needs to maintain her position, and that's not easy with someone new coming in.

00:01:42.117 --> 00:01:43.876
She comes from two different worlds,

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:45.658
They are two parallel worlds, after all.

00:01:45.882 --> 00:01:47.379
One is formatted for,

00:01:47.859 --> 00:01:51.046
The other one wasn't part of the plan.

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:54.992
Why is Harry the royal family's favorite prince?

00:01:56.430 --> 00:02:01.962
Harry, after all those difficult years, has finally become the most popular member of the royal family.

00:02:02.695 --> 00:02:05.335
Even in front of the Queen, it's still quite an achievement.

00:02:05.867 --> 00:02:07.831
How is William experiencing this situation?

00:02:08.491 --> 00:02:10.271
Does he really want to become king?

00:02:11.592 --> 00:02:13.416
William is the reason.

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:17.538
Perhaps a thoughtful person, someone who won't cross the line.

00:02:18.342 --> 00:02:21.483
William is ready to be king, but would he want to be?

00:02:21.623 --> 00:02:25.100
We cannot decide it, but he has been prepared for this role.

00:02:25.429 --> 00:02:28.896
For a long time, the lives of the two brothers were nothing but drama and scandal.

00:02:30.271 --> 00:02:33.251
They were born in palaces destined to become kings.

00:02:33.544 --> 00:02:38.646
And at the same time, they experienced the most human tragedy. They lost their mother when they were very young.

00:02:38.929 --> 00:02:41.470
On August 31, 1997,

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.918
Princess Diana died in a tragic car accident in Paris.

00:02:45.378 --> 00:02:47.773
leaving Harry and William orphans.

00:02:49.222 --> 00:02:52.526
Why did William refuse to attend his mother's funeral?

00:02:53.057 --> 00:02:54.871
And how did he change his mind?

00:02:55.871 --> 00:03:02.151
They would have liked to be alone, with their conscience, with their memory, with their tenderness for their mother, but it was impossible.

00:03:03.032 --> 00:03:06.192
How did Prince Harry rebuild his life after his mother's death?

00:03:06.372 --> 00:03:08.991
Why did he fall into severe depressions?

00:03:10.032 --> 00:03:11.576
Harry is his mother's baby.

00:03:11.651 --> 00:03:15.172
And so, when Harry becomes an orphan, when he loses his mother,

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:18.034
His world is completely collapsing.

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:22.237
How did the two princes cope with the loss of their mother?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.112
It has been a difficult fate,

00:03:26.144 --> 00:03:30.971
But ultimately, they were able to overcome this difficult moment and find the strength.

00:03:31.124 --> 00:03:36.168
For 20 years, the two princes have replaced Diana, the people's princess, in the hearts of the British.

00:03:36.409 --> 00:03:39.312
So, who are William and Harry really?

00:03:55.246 --> 00:03:57.408
November 27, 2017,

00:03:57.746 --> 00:03:59.371
Prince Harry creates a surprise.

00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:02.645
After only a year and a half of relationship,

00:04:03.186 --> 00:04:05.870
He announced his engagement in front of about a hundred journalists.

00:04:07.088 --> 00:04:09.954
summoned that very morning to the gardens of Kensington Palace.

00:04:15.198 --> 00:04:16.956
Prince, how did the proposal go?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.050
It was an unforgettable evening.

00:04:21.767 --> 00:04:22.627
Was it romantic?

00:04:22.721 --> 00:04:23.844
Of course it was.

00:04:31.447 --> 00:04:33.990
The fact that I fell in love with Megan incredibly quickly,

00:04:35.793 --> 00:04:40.074
It was confirmation for me that all the stars were aligned, that everything was just perfect.

00:04:40.253 --> 00:04:42.654
We are a fantastic team, we are sure of it.

00:04:42.918 --> 00:04:44.482
I'm very excited about all of this.

00:04:44.657 --> 00:04:45.902
Everything is perfect.

00:04:49.232 --> 00:04:54.028
The news, relayed by television stations around the world, had the effect of an earthquake.

00:04:55.649 --> 00:04:59.733
Prince Harry has announced his marriage to American actress Meghan Markle.

00:05:00.055 --> 00:05:03.918
Prince Harry and Meghan Markle are engaged, we're going to have an American princess.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:10.643
At 33, Harry, the most sought-after prince on the planet, has finally found the woman of his life.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.214
This is the event we've been waiting for for years.

00:05:15.267 --> 00:05:18.083
We were beginning to despair that this eternal bachelor would ever settle down.

00:05:18.144 --> 00:05:24.254
The women must have cried because they had to say, "It's over, we can no longer marry Cinderella's Prince Charming."

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.723
The lucky woman chosen is Meghan Markle.

00:05:30.966 --> 00:05:33.711
She's gorgeous, Meghan, she's absolutely stunning.

00:05:35.329 --> 00:05:36.974
I don't think Harry is bored.

00:05:37.473 --> 00:05:39.575
I think she's wonderful, she's very beautiful.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:40.953
And besides, she's a woman...

00:05:41.524 --> 00:05:42.759
She is a woman of her time.

00:05:44.055 --> 00:05:46.399
Virtually unknown in Europe just a year ago,

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:50.290
Now the future princess causes a riot every time she goes out.

00:05:52.711 --> 00:05:54.870
Gently, gently, step back. One step backward.

00:05:57.692 --> 00:06:05.421
There's a kind of Meghan mania that developed in an incredible amount of time. I mean, very, very quickly, she became one of the most famous women on the planet.

00:06:06.485 --> 00:06:14.586
Meghan is a dream come true because she is a young girl who comes from a modest background and is going to be in the most famous and most photographed family in the world.

00:06:15.704 --> 00:06:18.531
Please welcome the lovely Meghan Markle.

00:06:22.095 --> 00:06:24.095
Hello Meghan, you look magnificent.

00:06:25.183 --> 00:06:27.015
However, on paper...

00:06:27.112 --> 00:06:27.934
Meghan Markle,

00:06:28.314 --> 00:06:29.194
36 years old,

00:06:29.596 --> 00:06:30.576
who is a commoner,

00:06:30.917 --> 00:06:31.917
American,

00:06:32.276 --> 00:06:38.281
Being mixed race, an actress, divorced and older than Harry, she has nothing to appeal to the royal family.

00:06:40.469 --> 00:06:42.531
She's the anti-English princess when you look at her destiny.

00:06:42.725 --> 00:06:43.516
Actress,

00:06:44.062 --> 00:06:45.551
That's not what they prefer.

00:06:45.593 --> 00:06:49.759
The fact that she was divorced didn't sit well with the Queen of England. She doesn't fit into any category.

00:06:49.827 --> 00:06:52.805
Enough to make you choke on your scones at Buckingham Palace.

00:06:53.127 --> 00:06:59.614
Young people today think it's fantastic. An American actress who seems quite wild. And then Prince Harry, who himself was a bad boy.

00:07:00.394 --> 00:07:03.076
They are both the elixir of transgression.

00:07:03.134 --> 00:07:05.596
So they bring a little bit of madness.

00:07:06.877 --> 00:07:09.559
Faced with Harry's determination to marry Meghan,

00:07:10.307 --> 00:07:14.879
Queen Elizabeth II authorized this union, which was unthinkable just a few years ago.

00:07:16.634 --> 00:07:20.477
The fact that Queen Elizabeth approves of Harry's marriage to this young woman

00:07:21.625 --> 00:07:24.445
who is not from the aristocracy, not even English,

00:07:24.869 --> 00:07:26.569
It's a step towards modernity.

00:07:27.009 --> 00:07:35.260
It's a respect for the love of these two young people and breaking with the old, somewhat dusty aristocratic tradition; it also makes it a little more rock'n'roll.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:40.028
And Elizabeth II has not finished surprising these subjects.

00:07:40.497 --> 00:07:44.233
For Christmas, she invited Meghan Markle to join the Windsors.

00:07:44.826 --> 00:07:48.997
a privilege to which no fiancée in the family had ever been entitled.

00:07:49.737 --> 00:07:52.039
Meghan was lucky enough to spend Christmas with the Queen.

00:07:52.399 --> 00:08:00.328
It had never been done before. So the whole country, British citizens, thought, "Ah, times are changing, that's funny."

00:08:02.093 --> 00:08:09.576
The ceremony will take place on May 19th at Windsor Castle, the Queen's favorite country residence, 40 km from London.

00:08:10.435 --> 00:08:12.404
A fortress almost 1000 years old,

00:08:12.935 --> 00:08:14.920
steeped in history for the royal family.

00:08:15.983 --> 00:08:18.858
It's important to understand that this is an extraordinary gift.

00:08:19.249 --> 00:08:22.831
that the sovereign does because of the Royal Chapel of St. George at Windsor,

00:08:23.451 --> 00:08:25.314
It's an exceptional place.

00:08:25.857 --> 00:08:31.021
This is where Harry was baptized in 1984. So it's a place full of symbolism and memories for him.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.842
We are very close to London.

00:08:32.981 --> 00:08:37.452
But at the same time, we're not in the heart of the city because Harry isn't the heir to the throne, he's just his little brother.

00:08:38.692 --> 00:08:40.769
Just like Kate Middleton seven years ago,

00:08:40.942 --> 00:08:46.635
Meghan's every move is being scrutinized to try and uncover details about this ultra-secret wedding.

00:08:49.725 --> 00:08:51.887
I'm sure Meghan is already having sleepless nights.

00:08:52.389 --> 00:08:53.689
Because it's difficult.

00:08:54.509 --> 00:08:57.952
When you're organizing a thousand things, and you have a thousand guests, you can't forget anything.

00:08:58.393 --> 00:09:00.619
Meghan Markle must leave nothing to chance.

00:09:00.916 --> 00:09:04.977
starting with her wedding dress, which will be the focus of everyone's attention on the day of the ceremony.

00:09:05.735 --> 00:09:07.902
But one question is on everyone's lips.

00:09:08.423 --> 00:09:10.707
Will this dress make her a princess?

00:09:10.908 --> 00:09:13.030
The actress felt like she'd seen it all before.

00:09:13.188 --> 00:09:15.504
seen wearing white in an episode of Suits.

00:09:15.548 --> 00:09:17.173
the series that brought him to the public's attention.

00:09:18.585 --> 00:09:21.225
We can easily imagine that she's not going to get married in a leather jacket with a mini-skirt.

00:09:21.525 --> 00:09:23.864
That's unthinkable for a member of the royal family.

00:09:24.227 --> 00:09:27.607
Nevertheless, she has a say in things and she has always had a strong character.

00:09:28.364 --> 00:09:31.924
So we can indeed expect a little twist, a little touch of originality from him.

00:09:36.285 --> 00:09:40.910
Rumors suggest Meghan Markle will spend 450,000 euros on her wedding dress.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.754
one of the biggest expenses of the wedding.

00:09:46.147 --> 00:09:49.009
So there are a few stylists who have already been considered.

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:57.899
There is a lot of talk about a certain Misha Nonoo, who is a great friend of Meghan Markle, who has notably already dressed her on the sets of the series Suits.

00:09:59.423 --> 00:10:06.630
There is also Jessica Mulroney, who is of Canadian origin and who dresses, among others, the young wife of Justin Trudeau, the Canadian Prime Minister.

00:10:08.251 --> 00:10:13.596
And to make a lasting impression, Meghan Markle could also challenge religious traditions because of her family.

00:10:15.514 --> 00:10:17.177
We know she is very, very close to her mother.

00:10:17.738 --> 00:10:21.201
On the other hand, she has a slightly more distant relationship with her father, Thomas.

00:10:22.642 --> 00:10:25.043
Raised by her mother after her parents' divorce,

00:10:25.365 --> 00:10:29.930
Meghan rarely sees her father, who lives in Mexico, reclusive and penniless.

00:10:31.388 --> 00:10:36.513
One of the latest rumors says that she asked her mother to accompany her to the hotel and not her father.

00:10:36.996 --> 00:10:38.520
So that breaks with tradition.

00:10:38.951 --> 00:10:42.060
but it's also about being respected as a woman in her choices.

00:10:42.767 --> 00:10:50.757
She sets the tone, she sets the tone very quickly and this suggests an energetic young woman who will very, very successfully forge her path in the royal family.

00:10:52.937 --> 00:10:56.303
On the guest side, the future bride and groom would also like to create a surprise.

00:10:56.842 --> 00:10:59.314
with a garden that was much more glittery than regal.

00:11:00.443 --> 00:11:06.635
Meghan is no longer an actress on Suits, but she has remained very good friends with many of her co-stars, so we can hope to see some of them.

00:11:07.365 --> 00:11:10.460
She is also friends with Serena Williams, the tennis champion.

00:11:12.471 --> 00:11:14.932
We know that Harry is really good friends with Barack Obama.

00:11:15.054 --> 00:11:16.714
I can interview you if you want?

00:11:16.855 --> 00:11:19.936
No, no, let's do it as planned. I'm more comfortable this way.

00:11:20.057 --> 00:11:24.462
But neither Barack Obama nor the current US president, Donald Trump, will be present.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.825
Harry is only sixth in line to the throne.

00:11:29.003 --> 00:11:30.594
They will at least receive an invitation.

00:11:31.471 --> 00:11:34.753
The entire global elite dreams of getting an invitation.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:38.071
But only 600 privileged people will have the right to attend the ceremony.

00:11:39.378 --> 00:11:42.229
A marriage, which is also sparking the wildest rumors.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:47.434
The most incredible thing is the return of the Spice Girls, the famous English girl band.

00:11:52.181 --> 00:11:55.322
All this speculation is a boon for London bookmakers.

00:11:56.375 --> 00:12:00.453
If the number one sport in England is polo, the second is probably betting.

00:12:00.642 --> 00:12:03.766
And it is true that even now, bookmakers are having a field day.

00:12:04.805 --> 00:12:08.010
Will Prince Harry wear a beard on his wedding day, yes or no?

00:12:09.407 --> 00:12:12.611
Will Meghan Markle wear a tiara, yes or no, and which one?

00:12:14.653 --> 00:12:15.832
The taste of the cake,

00:12:15.933 --> 00:12:18.940
the wedding theme or the name of Meghan's maid of honor.

00:12:19.713 --> 00:12:21.897
All these bets are stirring up passions.

00:12:22.317 --> 00:12:27.419
The royal family had not generated such enthusiasm since the birth of Kate and William's children.

00:12:30.888 --> 00:12:32.610
It's a boy, it's a big baby.

00:12:33.996 --> 00:12:35.774
A much-anticipated resurgence of interest,

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:40.770
since this royal wedding could bring nearly 600 million euros to the British economy.

00:12:44.094 --> 00:12:45.914
The monarchy is also profitable.

00:12:45.972 --> 00:12:53.759
Every time there's a wedding in England, inevitably there are tourists, they sell merchandise, you know, improbable biscuit tins, objects more kitschy than the next.

00:12:55.009 --> 00:12:56.655
The English love it.

00:12:56.754 --> 00:12:59.033
These royal weddings, it's really...

00:13:00.047 --> 00:13:02.321
a breath of fresh air for the British.

00:13:03.379 --> 00:13:04.360
As you said,

00:13:05.004 --> 00:13:07.222
Now is the time to build our future together.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:09.591
We're only at the beginning.

00:13:10.972 --> 00:13:13.136
There is a lot to do, a lot to do.

00:13:13.956 --> 00:13:18.845
By marrying Meghan Markle, Prince Harry is bringing a smile back to the monarchy, just like William before him.

00:13:20.042 --> 00:13:23.562
The two brothers, always side by side, are more united than ever.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.629
Prince Harry has such a close relationship with his older brother William,

00:13:28.694 --> 00:13:32.008
They experienced so much together that it bonded them as children.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.792
that they could not ignore.

00:13:34.337 --> 00:13:37.037
Prince Harry's best man will be his older brother.

00:13:38.126 --> 00:13:42.411
Harry and William seem to have finally turned the page on the greatest tragedy of their lives.

00:13:56.043 --> 00:14:00.948
The nightmare of William and his brother Harry began on August 31, 1997.

00:14:14.674 --> 00:14:17.277
Everyone is in shock, there is a wave of shock.

00:14:17.711 --> 00:14:21.341
I thought it was a joke, I said it's not possible, she's too young.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:22.861
This type of person does not die.

00:14:23.259 --> 00:14:26.305
This is one of the great tragedies of the British monarchy.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.090
It was completely unpredictable.

00:14:30.087 --> 00:14:33.157
an accident that has shocked global public opinion.

00:14:33.957 --> 00:14:34.697
an icon.

00:14:34.854 --> 00:14:38.479
It was an injustice to her, she didn't deserve it, she was the people's princess.

00:14:38.572 --> 00:14:40.884
Then we immediately think of William and Harry.

00:14:41.945 --> 00:14:50.514
At the time of the tragedy, William, 15, and Harry, 12, were on holiday at Balmoral Castle in Scotland with the Queen and their father.

00:14:52.398 --> 00:14:58.026
We know that it was Prince Charles who was personally woken up on Sunday to announce the news to them.

00:14:59.105 --> 00:15:06.787
And they have absolutely touching and incredibly moving words when they talk about those moments, saying "we didn't understand, we didn't really understand".

00:15:08.369 --> 00:15:11.768
The death of their mother is obviously like heaven and earth collapsing.

00:15:13.171 --> 00:15:15.130
Elizabeth II, their grandmother,

00:15:15.249 --> 00:15:20.365
will then do everything to protect them from the media frenzy that is starting in London.

00:15:20.671 --> 00:15:26.107
The emotion was global. I think I would even use the word global hysteria rather than global emotion.

00:15:26.594 --> 00:15:27.831
It was insane.

00:15:27.967 --> 00:15:34.896
The Queen's first reaction when she learned of it a little while earlier was to say to immediately remove the radios and televisions from the palace.

00:15:35.076 --> 00:15:37.447
The queen desperately tried to be a grandmother,

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.642
to protect his grandsons.

00:15:40.302 --> 00:15:45.333
She wanted them to have a few days at Balmoral, just to come to terms with this terrible news.

00:15:48.688 --> 00:15:51.491
If the queen wants to cut the two princes off from the rest of the world,

00:15:51.596 --> 00:15:54.256
It's because she herself has already experienced such a tragedy.

00:15:54.399 --> 00:15:57.936
The sudden death of his father, George VI, in 1952,

00:15:58.024 --> 00:15:59.716
when she was 25 years old.

00:16:02.041 --> 00:16:03.899
Elisabeth knew exactly what she was doing.

00:16:04.322 --> 00:16:07.306
She herself learned of her father's death while she was traveling.

00:16:07.821 --> 00:16:11.082
She left England as a princess, she returned as a queen.

00:16:11.764 --> 00:16:13.687
and the media frenzy,

00:16:14.667 --> 00:16:20.170
She knows what it's like to suffer from it, and she didn't want to impose it on her grandsons, who were so young and so fragile.

00:16:23.677 --> 00:16:30.038
Despite the Queen's efforts, the fervor surrounding Diana is gaining ground at Balmoral and will hit the two princes hard.

00:16:36.149 --> 00:16:42.597
The day after receiving the news, they nevertheless attended a mass near Balmoral, where they were forced to see people,

00:16:44.736 --> 00:16:46.878
to see little notes, to see flowers.

00:16:47.096 --> 00:16:49.221
Harry says this rather shocking thing.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:55.245
He said that he himself could not cry, but that the people who touched him had hands wet with their own tears.

00:16:58.464 --> 00:17:04.699
The two brothers are all the more devastated by grief as they cannot stop thinking about their last conversation with their mother Diana.

00:17:06.161 --> 00:17:08.823
A phone call that took place a few hours before the tragedy.

00:17:09.623 --> 00:17:13.746
They are playing with their cousins ​​in the garden, the weather is nice, it's great, it's summer.

00:17:13.807 --> 00:17:20.414
She calls from Paris, says she will be back the next day and tells them, among other things, that she has found them some lovely and beautiful gifts.

00:17:20.712 --> 00:17:23.294
And in fact, they shorten this phone call a little bit.

00:17:23.416 --> 00:17:27.603
Mom, let's go back to playing, everything's fine for you, great, see you in a few days.

00:17:28.728 --> 00:17:34.024
For 20 years, Harry and William have regretted the casual attitude they had towards their mother on that tragic day.

00:17:37.265 --> 00:17:42.073
This last conversation really haunted them because, obviously, they couldn't have known it would be the last.

00:17:42.531 --> 00:17:46.737
They were deeply hurt to realize they should have paid more attention to her, been more present.

00:17:47.692 --> 00:17:48.794
take more time.

00:17:55.019 --> 00:17:58.456
William and Harry spend 6 dreadful days at Balmoral.

00:17:58.707 --> 00:18:02.941
But they are unaware that an even more shocking ordeal awaits them upon their return to London.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:04.832
Their mother's state funeral.

00:18:07.184 --> 00:18:13.052
Diana's funeral was a major trauma for her two brothers. It was an absolutely terrible time for them.

00:18:14.393 --> 00:18:18.191
And that was truly overwhelming, an image that shook all of England.

00:18:18.455 --> 00:18:20.541
On September 6, 1997,

00:18:21.182 --> 00:18:24.565
William and Harry, who have become the most famous orphans on the planet,

00:18:24.955 --> 00:18:27.409
find themselves exposed in front of cameras from all over the world.

00:18:32.268 --> 00:18:35.779
When you see them behind, following their mother's coffin...

00:18:36.836 --> 00:18:39.000
That's still the most moving thing, though.

00:18:42.103 --> 00:18:44.823
They possess an incredible, incredible dignity.

00:18:45.204 --> 00:18:52.571
How come they don't sob? How do they manage? In the evening, when we get home, we imagine them collapsed in their beds, crying into their pillows.

00:18:52.759 --> 00:19:03.185
At that moment, they embodied the royal side of the family, meaning they were straightforward and never showed anything. It truly reflected the queen's motto: "Never explain, never complain."

00:19:04.944 --> 00:19:13.583
Two and a half billion viewers in 180 countries are watching these poignant images, and wondering about the letter seen on a bed of lilies.

00:19:14.161 --> 00:19:15.583
Diana's favorite flowers.

00:19:17.208 --> 00:19:23.287
I'm thinking of the thing that moved us the most; it was the word "Mum" written on the bag by Prince Harry.

00:19:24.839 --> 00:19:29.901
We all wanted to take him in our arms and say, "Poor little boy, his mother has died,

00:19:30.683 --> 00:19:33.910
He is going through an ordeal that no one wants to experience.

00:19:35.347 --> 00:19:37.671
Harry and his brother William do not crack.

00:19:38.089 --> 00:19:42.674
However, just a few days earlier, they categorically refused to participate in this procession.

00:19:44.636 --> 00:19:55.048
It's already terrible enough to have lost your mother, so to experience your grief during a 30-minute procession through the capital, with billions of people watching and scrutinizing us on television,

00:19:55.123 --> 00:19:58.303
Can you imagine how terrible this is? It's a burden for these children.

00:19:58.361 --> 00:20:03.747
They would have liked to be alone with their conscience, with their memory, with their tenderness for their mother, but it was impossible.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:09.597
It is Prince Philip, the Queen's husband and grandfather of the two boys,

00:20:09.848 --> 00:20:12.817
who will convince William to take his place in the procession.

00:20:14.048 --> 00:20:19.134
It was really his grandfather, the Duke of Edinburgh, who said to him, "What if I come with you? What if I am with you?"

00:20:19.192 --> 00:20:22.854
And then, all of a sudden, William really felt the whole family reunited.

00:20:22.915 --> 00:20:26.782
He will say to himself, "Diana performed a miracle beyond death."

00:20:26.798 --> 00:20:32.199
That is to say, she reconciles a family that was torn apart, and his normal place is to walk behind her.

00:20:32.945 --> 00:20:35.702
Supported by their grandfather and their father, Prince Charles,

00:20:36.775 --> 00:20:41.237
The boys will walk with their heads down almost 2 kilometers behind their mother's coffin.

00:20:42.337 --> 00:20:43.521
Dignified and stoic.

00:20:44.488 --> 00:20:47.368
They earn the respect and affection of an entire people.

00:20:48.589 --> 00:20:52.866
It's part of their duty, in a way, but at 15, 12 years old, you don't get to choose.

00:20:53.211 --> 00:21:00.275
I think it was extremely violent, and that's why we have so much sympathy for Harry and William today.

00:21:01.765 --> 00:21:03.705
William hides behind his lock of hair.

00:21:04.265 --> 00:21:10.358
Like Diana, with her famous look from beneath her fringe. He tries to shield himself from the stares of millions of people.

00:21:11.155 --> 00:21:13.437
Harry, even more fragile,

00:21:14.276 --> 00:21:16.778
He said it was the biggest shock of his life.

00:21:16.858 --> 00:21:22.063
He felt it was wrong to ask a child to do that, and that today, he believes it wouldn't be done anymore.

00:21:25.106 --> 00:21:29.856
And the emotion will rise even further during the religious ceremony at Westminster Abbey.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:35.267
when Elton John sits down at the piano to pay tribute to his friend Diana.

00:21:37.263 --> 00:21:39.164
Candle in the Wind, by Elton John,

00:21:40.339 --> 00:21:42.248
That was probably the most moving moment.

00:21:42.839 --> 00:21:44.920
Since he was one of Diana's best friends,

00:21:45.082 --> 00:21:48.765
And yes, there was so much emotion in her voice, there was so much sadness.

00:21:49.605 --> 00:21:51.483
It was a moment when everyone cried.

00:21:51.571 --> 00:21:54.613
Even in the royal court, we see people crying.

00:22:09.901 --> 00:22:11.665
I was watching television and crying.

00:22:12.271 --> 00:22:14.961
And I was thinking, they don't even have the right to cry.

00:22:15.081 --> 00:22:17.783
There were flashes of light on the two children who were unaware.

00:22:22.811 --> 00:22:27.354
Prince Harry would later confide, "That was the only time I really thought I was going to break down."

00:22:27.414 --> 00:22:31.500
I had promised Mom I wouldn't cry. At that moment, I almost did.

00:22:41.271 --> 00:22:42.773
Having endured the ordeal of the funeral,

00:22:43.133 --> 00:22:46.315
Harry must learn to live without his mother, whom he cherished.

00:22:47.078 --> 00:22:50.380
He doesn't yet know that this will be the toughest fight of his life.

00:22:51.224 --> 00:22:52.866
Harry is his mother's baby.

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:55.225
And so, when Harry becomes an orphan,

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:59.192
When he loses his mother, his world completely collapses.

00:22:59.833 --> 00:23:02.931
He can't believe what's happening to him.

00:23:03.458 --> 00:23:04.911
That seems inconceivable.

00:23:04.972 --> 00:23:10.301
He will say and repeat that in order not to suffer, he had to not think about his mother.

00:23:10.776 --> 00:23:12.676
Harry suffered terribly.

00:23:13.955 --> 00:23:17.659
He said it recently, he confided in us. He did, after all, go through some very violent depressive episodes.

00:23:19.434 --> 00:23:21.021
He really came close at times.

00:23:22.278 --> 00:23:23.922
to lose common sense.

00:23:24.981 --> 00:23:29.843
Harry spoke about this trauma for the first time only a few months ago on the radio.

00:23:31.294 --> 00:23:37.313
I can calmly say that losing my mother at 12 years old and consequently blocking all my emotions for the last 20 years.

00:23:38.508 --> 00:23:42.432
This has had serious consequences, not only on my personal life, but also in my work.

00:23:45.076 --> 00:23:47.398
The young prince speaks of it discreetly.

00:23:47.798 --> 00:23:48.839
But in reality,

00:23:49.056 --> 00:23:52.199
The lost teenager experienced a long descent into hell.

00:24:03.189 --> 00:24:04.611
After his mother's funeral,

00:24:04.887 --> 00:24:08.728
William will give the impression of handling grief much better than his brother.

00:24:10.009 --> 00:24:12.150
He resumes his life as a high school student at Eton.

00:24:13.667 --> 00:24:18.666
William, for his part, showed no sign of it. He was 15 years old, and he continued to pursue his studies.

00:24:18.726 --> 00:24:28.272
All around him, he has both teachers and classmates who support him and are by his side. He is integrated into something that will protect him and act as a kind of cocoon.

00:24:30.708 --> 00:24:34.388
In reality, if William doesn't succumb, it's because he has no choice.

00:24:34.409 --> 00:24:36.048
He is the eldest and future king,

00:24:36.548 --> 00:24:38.833
and he has no right to feel sorry for himself.

00:24:40.067 --> 00:24:41.567
William is the reason.

00:24:42.192 --> 00:24:43.904
the mastermind,

00:24:44.963 --> 00:24:47.388
the one who will not cross the line.

00:24:48.451 --> 00:24:49.779
His path is chosen.

00:24:49.833 --> 00:24:51.776
He does not have the freedom to refuse it.

00:24:52.333 --> 00:24:55.192
He must get a good education, he must learn his job as king.

00:24:55.911 --> 00:24:57.981
It's easier for William, he has a crutch.

00:24:58.411 --> 00:25:00.161
This crutch is quite strong; it's the crown.

00:25:00.536 --> 00:25:01.798
He knows where he needs to go.

00:25:02.838 --> 00:25:06.502
From the moment he was born, William was programmed to be exemplary in every way.

00:25:08.284 --> 00:25:14.250
At that time, after his mother's death, William became more aware than ever of his role and place within the royal family.

00:25:15.409 --> 00:25:17.690
During his last three years of boarding school at Eton,

00:25:17.899 --> 00:25:19.487
That's Elisabeth, his grandmother.

00:25:19.799 --> 00:25:22.737
who will be responsible for teaching him his future role as king.

00:25:23.299 --> 00:25:26.560
His grandmother receives him at least one afternoon a week, perhaps more often.

00:25:28.190 --> 00:25:29.237
The queen knows this all too well.

00:25:29.824 --> 00:25:31.825
Being a king is not something you can just improvise.

00:25:33.207 --> 00:25:41.175
She explains to him both her experience and memories, and what he can expect as king. She essentially gives him a lesson, drawing on the experience of over 60 years of reign.

00:25:46.105 --> 00:25:52.121
At 18, in memory of his mother, William spent three months in Chile on a community and ecological project.

00:25:54.753 --> 00:25:57.354
I wanted to do something constructive this year.

00:25:59.188 --> 00:26:01.030
I really needed to feel useful.

00:26:01.971 --> 00:26:04.762
I felt I needed to help people in need.

00:26:06.100 --> 00:26:08.514
and that I encounter different populations from around the world.

00:26:09.433 --> 00:26:15.259
It's the idea of ​​being able to have a normal life. It's almost a mantra for William, meaning he repeats it constantly.

00:26:16.950 --> 00:26:22.075
This is even the first time that a future king of England has been filmed to this extent in his private life.

00:26:23.928 --> 00:26:29.395
We see Prince William, for example, cleaning toilets in a center for neglected children.

00:26:31.435 --> 00:26:36.320
There is this extremely strong desire, totally inherited from Diana, to be close to people.

00:26:37.085 --> 00:26:37.940
Hi, it's Will.

00:26:40.358 --> 00:26:44.831
Unable to bear the excessive media attention he has been subjected to since the death of his mother, Lady Diana,

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:50.470
William breaks with 150 years of tradition by choosing to attend the university of his choice.

00:26:52.612 --> 00:26:58.878
It will be a matter of choosing the University of St Andrews, which is not at all a university attended by members of the royal family.

00:26:59.762 --> 00:27:02.564
He chose discretion and, above all, distance from the media.

00:27:03.523 --> 00:27:07.227
Since his mother's death, he wants to be in a more discreet place.

00:27:08.875 --> 00:27:13.298
When this unexpected choice is announced, applications for female registration skyrocket.

00:27:13.828 --> 00:27:16.490
Among the contenders was a certain Kate Middleton.

00:27:19.076 --> 00:27:24.800
That year, enrollments increased by 44%. Many girls wanted to attend university, and Kate Middleton was one of them.

00:27:26.402 --> 00:27:31.891
By joining this faculty, Kate secretly hopes to be able to get her hands on the most eligible bachelor in England.

00:27:33.106 --> 00:27:35.876
She went to the same university because she wanted to catch him.

00:27:35.949 --> 00:27:37.854
She wanted to go out with him.

00:27:38.652 --> 00:27:43.184
It was far from certain that she would go further than just a quick encounter.

00:27:44.964 --> 00:27:48.872
From a very young age, the young woman dreamed of marrying William and becoming a princess.

00:27:51.194 --> 00:27:57.799
From a very young age, at school, she had a fondness for the royal family. She always loved it.

00:27:58.326 --> 00:28:00.647
She already had a poster of William in her room.

00:28:00.722 --> 00:28:04.286
She always wanted to become a princess, ever since she was very young.

00:28:06.016 --> 00:28:07.644
and to marry Prince William.

00:28:08.512 --> 00:28:12.469
Urged on by her family, she does everything to seduce the young prince.

00:28:14.441 --> 00:28:19.272
It was like a bomb sent by the family to catch the future king of England.

00:28:22.394 --> 00:28:23.972
On March 27, 2002,

00:28:24.114 --> 00:28:28.073
At a charity fashion show, Kate will finally achieve her goal.

00:28:30.261 --> 00:28:33.918
She thought to herself, William will be there, I have to get his attention.

00:28:34.055 --> 00:28:36.912
So she wore a rather transparent dress.

00:28:37.318 --> 00:28:38.812
which had an immediate effect.

00:28:38.883 --> 00:28:42.840
And there, she goes from being an intelligent, nice, serious girl,

00:28:43.805 --> 00:28:45.211
to the sexy girl.

