William reportedly said, "Wow, Kate, that's hot."

00:28:48.380 --> 00:28:49.719
It was love at first sight.

00:28:50.662 --> 00:28:55.479
It was that evening that the couple shared their first kiss and began a serious relationship.

00:28:56.618 --> 00:28:59.446
However, Kate doesn't really fit the profile of the ideal princess.

00:28:59.826 --> 00:29:01.364
Coming from a working-class background,

00:29:01.400 --> 00:29:03.165
She is not part of the aristocracy.

00:29:05.071 --> 00:29:07.961
She is a truck driver, she is the daughter of Michael and Carol Middleton.

00:29:08.728 --> 00:29:12.884
His parents were fairly normal people who genuinely wanted to rise in society.

00:29:14.321 --> 00:29:20.093
Ambitious, his parents, former employees of an airline, made their fortune in party supplies.

00:29:22.279 --> 00:29:30.466
They are a lower-middle-class family, if you will, until he creates this party accessories company that makes them what we call the nouveau riche.

00:29:32.118 --> 00:29:40.590
The Middleton family represents the "self-made man" type who succeeds and climbs the social ladder. It's a waking dream.

00:29:42.425 --> 00:29:47.385
For William, who suffered from his parents' divorce and the death of his mother when he was 15,

00:29:47.651 --> 00:29:49.712
The Middletons are a blessing.

00:29:52.160 --> 00:29:55.277
Prince William has found a sense of normalcy again in the Middletons.

00:29:55.439 --> 00:29:59.509
normality, a united family, a healthy family, a stable family.

00:29:59.767 --> 00:30:02.907
It was something he had never experienced and something he truly longed for.

00:30:04.096 --> 00:30:08.311
William discovers something as natural as being able to eat breakfast in his pajamas.

00:30:09.173 --> 00:30:11.298
a simplicity he had often dreamed of.

00:30:13.579 --> 00:30:20.039
Kate's parents really did serve as surrogate parents for William at one point. He spent Christmases with them.

00:30:20.560 --> 00:30:26.263
He is extraordinarily happy at his in-laws' house. He has spent entire weekends there rather than going to his grandmother's palaces.

00:30:26.805 --> 00:30:29.790
Now that William has finally found the warmth of a home,

00:30:30.070 --> 00:30:33.055
His brother Harry is spiraling into hell.

00:30:41.823 --> 00:30:43.474
Early January 2005,

00:30:43.586 --> 00:30:46.070
The darling of the English commits the irreparable.

00:30:46.633 --> 00:30:49.471
Harry is photographed wearing a swastika at a masked ball.

00:30:50.471 --> 00:30:52.755
The image has scandalized the entire world.

00:30:54.636 --> 00:30:59.863
When these photos are published in the press, they create a terrible buzz, a terrible bad buzz.

00:31:00.445 --> 00:31:02.461
It brings back terrible memories.

00:31:02.984 --> 00:31:06.832
England having been threatened with destruction by the Germans and by Hitler.

00:31:07.602 --> 00:31:14.097
We are 15 days away from the commemorations of the Jewish Holocaust which are to be celebrated in London.

00:31:15.056 --> 00:31:19.118
This is going to cause quite a stir in England and the whole world.

00:31:20.476 --> 00:31:22.256
Since the death of his mother 8 years earlier,

00:31:22.455 --> 00:31:24.016
Harry is adrift.

00:31:24.516 --> 00:31:27.258
Every evening, after classes, as a remedy for grief,

00:31:27.758 --> 00:31:30.961
He found nothing but alcohol, drugs, and sleepless nights.

00:31:31.875 --> 00:31:37.183
Very soon, the particularly boozy evenings will begin. The prince loves gin.

00:31:40.022 --> 00:31:44.148
But there is also a little more than alcohol, there are drugs circulating as well.

00:31:46.668 --> 00:31:49.341
Harry is not a saint, he's a gossip.

00:31:49.443 --> 00:31:51.564
He's definitely the bad boy of the family.

00:31:52.346 --> 00:31:57.174
A life of debauchery that makes him completely forget that he is constantly followed by a horde of paparazzi.

00:31:59.010 --> 00:32:04.377
He is the only member of the royal family who has been seen staggering out of a club to the point where he almost fell.

