Also remember that he was nicknamed: Harry Pothead.

00:32:08.737 --> 00:32:13.080
Obviously a play on words with Harry Potter because people said he smoked joints, etc.

00:32:14.126 --> 00:32:17.142
He is also the only prince photographed naked.

00:32:17.268 --> 00:32:21.686
As in this suite of hotels in Las Vegas in the company of several young women who were also undressed.

00:32:26.353 --> 00:32:30.913
This was a second major breach, we might say, of his role as a member of the royal family.

00:32:31.855 --> 00:32:33.980
This is the famous strip poker in Las Vegas.

00:32:34.517 --> 00:32:38.734
He completely lets loose, we find him naked, it's not a big deal.

00:32:38.825 --> 00:32:43.403
The problem is that there's always someone around him ready to spill the beans.

00:32:44.480 --> 00:32:49.141
Harry never forgot how journalists harassed his mother until her tragic death.

00:32:55.087 --> 00:32:57.049
On October 22, 2004,

00:32:57.124 --> 00:32:57.862
that night,

