And Harry is going to go crazy.

00:33:04.071 --> 00:33:08.856
It's going to escalate to physical violence; he's capable of becoming violent in these kinds of circumstances.

00:33:09.237 --> 00:33:13.178
The prince doesn't hesitate to hit a few paparazzi who want some private photos.

00:33:18.077 --> 00:33:19.929
Even if it goes further and further,

00:33:20.165 --> 00:33:23.249
The British people remain exceptionally lenient with Harry.

00:33:23.810 --> 00:33:25.600
her little orphaned prince.

00:33:27.973 --> 00:33:30.192
He is suffering, this is his way of reacting.

00:33:30.598 --> 00:33:31.715
He is in rebellion.

00:33:31.818 --> 00:33:33.317
Yes, we forgive him everything.

