The British people love to hear about his antics, his moments of madness.

00:33:38.959 --> 00:33:40.798
It makes him more human.

00:33:41.951 --> 00:33:46.109
If Harry can get away with anything, it's also because he's the second oldest in the family.

00:33:46.451 --> 00:33:49.913
A position that protects him and allows him to be himself.

00:33:51.636 --> 00:33:56.643
Harry will never ascend the throne. He doesn't have the position or the pressure that William has.

00:33:57.859 --> 00:34:02.725
He's not the oldest, he's the youngest, so we have the opportunity to do more silly things, I think.

00:34:03.602 --> 00:34:08.906
This is a completely fundamental trait in Harry's personality; he can afford to be a little more frivolous than his brother.

00:34:10.742 --> 00:34:12.319
While he is adrift,

00:34:12.414 --> 00:34:14.320
Harry is very close to his family.

00:34:14.544 --> 00:34:18.263
His father, Charles, does everything he can to prevent him from completely sinking.

00:34:19.648 --> 00:34:22.090
In fact, Charles is an excellent father.

00:34:22.452 --> 00:34:26.932
When Harry begins to flirt dangerously with cannabis use,

00:34:28.514 --> 00:34:31.398
He takes her to a rehabilitation center.

00:34:31.463 --> 00:34:33.698
And Charles does this quite intelligently.

00:34:33.755 --> 00:34:36.608
In fact, he's a more modern dad than you might think.

00:34:36.702 --> 00:34:40.306
He is a very affectionate father and much more demonstrative than one might imagine.

00:34:40.623 --> 00:34:45.171
After Diana's death, Charles tried to be a good father to Harry and William.

00:34:45.229 --> 00:34:47.141
as they recently confided.

00:34:48.623 --> 00:34:54.848
"Our dad, Charles, was there for two. He tried his best to replace mom and we will be eternally grateful to him."

00:34:56.390 --> 00:34:58.070
Despite his father's support,

