It was also a way for him to distance himself from his family and grow up; wanting to be away from his loved ones was a sign of maturity on his part.

00:35:50.155 --> 00:35:51.534
It brought him a great deal.

00:35:52.275 --> 00:35:59.978
His status as a prince of England requires him to have the government's permission, which he will obtain on one condition: to be there incognito.

00:36:02.619 --> 00:36:05.481
He showed that he existed for his own worth, in fact.

00:36:06.572 --> 00:36:12.986
Not simply because he has a title, not simply because he is a king's son, but because he is a soldier who fights, and who is respected by his comrades.

00:36:14.525 --> 00:36:17.530
Surrounded by ordinary soldiers, Harry blossoms like never before.

00:36:18.409 --> 00:36:21.210
But his secret identity will be discovered.

00:36:22.476 --> 00:36:26.377
It will be revealed by an American website; his presence will be revealed there.

00:36:27.561 --> 00:36:30.522
Overwhelmed by his global fame, he becomes a target.

00:36:32.702 --> 00:36:37.529
Ultimately, he was a threat to the entire troop, because he could be the target of an attack or a kidnapping.

00:36:38.186 --> 00:36:42.531
By remaining in Afghanistan, he is putting his life in danger and, consequently, the lives of the soldiers around him.

00:36:43.733 --> 00:36:46.195
