It's certain that they have...

00:54:48.080 --> 00:54:50.940
They are separated by an ocean. They come from two different worlds.

00:54:51.742 --> 00:54:53.182
They are two parallel worlds, after all.

00:54:53.702 --> 00:54:55.003
One is formatted for,

00:54:55.483 --> 00:54:56.286
the other,

00:54:57.405 --> 00:54:58.671
That wasn't part of the plan.

00:55:00.367 --> 00:55:07.079
Everything sets Kate, the commoner destined to be a princess, apart from Meghan, the feminist from the rough neighborhoods of Los Angeles.

00:55:09.195 --> 00:55:11.762
I don't think Kate and Meghan had that much in common.

00:55:12.585 --> 00:55:16.828
between an American actress and an English woman,

00:55:18.699 --> 00:55:21.442
who doesn't do much else besides being a prince's wife.

00:55:22.083 --> 00:55:33.216
Kate, today, is the perfect family woman, a little too polished, what does her daily life consist of? Taking care of her children 100%, getting involved in a few causes, but you can tell that she is not as passionate a woman as Meghan can be when it comes to defending causes.

00:55:35.275 --> 00:55:41.258
The press has already run headlines about the sisters-in-law war, betting on the rise of rivalries between the two young women.

00:55:43.640 --> 00:55:45.560
How will they manage?

00:55:45.619 --> 00:55:47.191
That's really the big question mark.

00:55:48.016 --> 00:55:49.275
That's what's going to be exciting to follow.

00:55:49.356 --> 00:55:50.978
They have every interest in getting along well,

00:55:51.808 --> 00:55:54.796
to ensure harmony,

00:55:56.430 --> 00:55:59.953
And above all, there must be no leaks to the press saying there's rivalry, because then...

00:56:02.217 --> 00:56:05.515
It's a selling point, but for them, it would be a bit of a devastating problem.

00:56:06.147 --> 00:56:08.596
That makes me laugh, there won't be any rivalry.

00:56:08.873 --> 00:56:10.374
Faced with the weight of the crown,

00:56:10.717 --> 00:56:15.625
The only two commoner princesses in the royal family might instead choose to join forces.

00:56:17.739 --> 00:56:21.625
I think they are already very aware that it's about union,

00:56:22.264 --> 00:56:23.617
peace between them

00:56:23.750 --> 00:56:25.441
who will save them.

00:56:25.467 --> 00:56:30.148
Kate is intelligent enough, and I think Meghan is too, so in the long run it will work out extremely well.

00:56:31.331 --> 00:56:34.669
It would even seem that Kate is delighted to share the pressure.

00:56:37.065 --> 00:56:43.784
Kate is very happy to have support. She is glad to have someone with whom to share the responsibilities of being a member of the royal family.

00:56:45.511 --> 00:56:46.893
There, she has an ally.

00:56:48.384 --> 00:56:56.081
Having been in the public eye for 15 years, Kate would not be unhappy with a little media respite, to enjoy her third child in complete discretion.

00:56:58.768 --> 00:57:07.091
Kate Middleton's first two pregnancies were an unprecedented media frenzy, particularly the birth of Prince George, it's true, but we experienced some of the same scenes of hysteria.

00:57:10.534 --> 00:57:20.588
Perhaps the arrival of Meghan and Harry as a married couple within this royal family will allow Kate to have that degree of withdrawal which will allow her to take care of and devote herself 100% to her children.

00:57:24.150 --> 00:57:29.216
Since she started dating Prince Harry, Meghan Markle has become the number one attraction in England.

00:57:34.934 --> 00:57:43.987
On September 25th, a year after their incredible whirlwind romance, Prince Harry and Meghan Markle finally made their love story official at the Invictus Games in Toronto.

00:57:47.572 --> 00:57:50.395
It was a very well-organized entrance.

00:57:51.655 --> 00:57:55.939
with an almost perfect choreography so that she would arrive with him.

00:57:56.960 --> 00:58:03.161
Meghan herself chose a very unconventional outfit. She arrived in ripped jeans with sunglasses and a boyfriend shirt.

00:58:05.983 --> 00:58:09.951
In this first appearance, Meghan already established her style.

00:58:12.702 --> 00:58:16.335
This is a far cry from the hyper-protocolary codes to which Kate Middleton adheres.

00:58:17.503 --> 00:58:19.244
But the couple didn't stop there.

00:58:19.806 --> 00:58:25.271
It's unprecedented for an unmarried member of the royal family to dare to kiss his partner at an official event.

00:58:30.219 --> 00:58:35.795
Not only did they hold hands, which is very rare for a royal couple, they kissed; it was an image that surprised everyone.

00:58:35.934 --> 00:58:37.606
We knew right away that it was serious.

00:58:37.715 --> 00:58:39.528
You can feel that there is a true, sincere love.

00:58:41.025 --> 00:58:43.685
She's here at the Invictus Games, she's happy to be with her boyfriend.

00:58:45.248 --> 00:58:51.196
Starting with the Invictus Games, Meghan Markle became in one evening the target of a global media frenzy that would never cease.

00:58:55.114 --> 00:58:57.998
Media outlets around the world are rushing to find out more about this young girl.

00:58:58.219 --> 00:59:01.354
Who is she? What does she look like? What is her daily life like?

00:59:01.443 --> 00:59:04.632
The paparazzi are obviously chasing her, just like Kate Middleton did back then.

00:59:06.036 --> 00:59:08.385
And she becomes the target of attack.

00:59:09.079 --> 00:59:11.117
Anything goes when it comes to selling.

00:59:11.177 --> 00:59:15.398
Because this is the first time a prince from the royal family has had a relationship with a mixed-race woman.

00:59:16.297 --> 00:59:17.500
And yet...

00:59:17.795 --> 00:59:20.558
This simple love will awaken old racist sentiments.

00:59:22.320 --> 00:59:29.785
Obviously, the fact that she is mixed race has fueled many conversations. For example, is this normal? Is this permissible?

00:59:31.105 --> 00:59:37.672
Is this good or bad for the royal bloodline? We are really hearing reactions, which include racist remarks.

00:59:40.570 --> 00:59:42.086
The worst horrors are circulating.

00:59:42.617 --> 00:59:45.008
Meghan is even accused of threatening the British monarchy.

00:59:47.588 --> 00:59:49.007
There was even, remember,

00:59:50.528 --> 00:59:58.514
Far-right politicians have said that Meghan's engagement to Prince Harry will tarnish the royal family. So it's gone very, very far.

01:00:02.668 --> 01:00:09.670
Although used to gossip and fake news, the young actress will also have to face outlandish accusations coming from her own family.

01:00:13.034 --> 01:00:21.502
She has a half-sister who is hateful to the extreme, who honestly is overflowing with jealousy of Meghan's success, and who has said the worst possible and imaginable horrors.

01:00:24.961 --> 01:00:28.509
However, 17 years separate the two women who have never lived together.

01:00:31.188 --> 01:00:37.677
Samantha Grant, who said quite plainly, "she always dreamed of becoming a princess, she had pictures of Prince Harry."

01:00:39.039 --> 01:00:43.337
In short, you know, she's an opportunist, she's an ambitious woman ready to do anything to get there.

01:00:43.884 --> 01:00:50.078
In the coming weeks, she is preparing to release a book which will be simply titled "Confessions of the Sister of a Future Ambitious Princess".

01:00:51.827 --> 01:00:55.643
So, all of England is already, in a way, waiting to read this famous book.

01:00:57.100 --> 01:00:58.607
Meghan sells.

01:00:58.646 --> 01:01:01.886
The English tabloids are having a field day also unpacking the story of his half-brother.

01:01:04.443 --> 01:01:13.054
Thomas Markle Jr. went to prison last year after holding a gun to his girlfriend's head. So, they're a rather colorful family.

01:01:16.333 --> 01:01:19.016
Harry is outraged by the attacks his girlfriend has suffered.

01:01:20.561 --> 01:01:23.564
From the beginning, Harry understood that there was a danger to Meghan.

01:01:23.923 --> 01:01:25.541
And Prince Harry cannot stand it.

01:01:26.463 --> 01:01:30.751
This media lynching painfully reminds him of the one his mother experienced.

01:01:33.438 --> 01:01:36.480
He remembers very, very well how much of a burden it must have been for his mother, for Diana.

01:01:37.454 --> 01:01:40.922
And he refuses to let his partner carry the weight.

01:01:43.148 --> 01:01:49.514
Furious, Harry releases an official statement demanding an end to the racist and sexist attacks against his girlfriend.

01:01:51.952 --> 01:01:58.498
An extremely firm, extremely outraged reaction when Meghan was attacked on social media and in the press.

01:02:00.662 --> 01:02:02.304
It was unprecedented.

01:02:02.367 --> 01:02:08.120
He said: "You stop, you're talking nonsense. It's not true. She's my girlfriend, my future wife.

01:02:09.929 --> 01:02:12.382
So you accept and you stop."

01:02:12.880 --> 01:02:13.999
Through his statements,

01:02:14.340 --> 01:02:19.163
Harry is subtly preparing public opinion and his family for the announcement of his engagement.

01:02:19.702 --> 01:02:23.361
But he's missing just one agreement, and the most important one,

01:02:23.565 --> 01:02:25.781
that of his grandmother, the queen.

01:02:26.744 --> 01:02:28.065
Please sit down.

01:02:29.487 --> 01:02:38.489
I think the Queen must have been preparing herself for the idea that Harry would, after all, dare to do something different.

01:02:39.432 --> 01:02:47.077
And the queen gave her approval for a foreigner, a television actress, it's really exceptional, it's unprecedented in the royal family.

01:02:47.518 --> 01:02:53.244
If the Queen agrees to admit into the royal family a young, mixed-race, divorced American woman,

01:02:53.665 --> 01:02:57.327
It's because she learned from the failed marriage of Charles and Diana.

01:02:59.272 --> 01:03:02.545
Elisabeth finally understood that there was nothing to be done.

01:03:02.582 --> 01:03:04.089
A love match,

01:03:04.166 --> 01:03:08.557
Ultimately, it's the only thing we can believe in, because an arranged marriage always ends up falling apart.

01:03:09.403 --> 01:03:15.404
Finally, on November 27, 2017, Harry and Meghan officially announced their engagement.

01:03:15.746 --> 01:03:19.984
This was an opportunity for the couple to reveal the scenario of the marriage proposal.

01:03:22.246 --> 01:03:23.605
It was an evening like any other.

01:03:24.190 --> 01:03:27.487
A quiet evening. What were we doing? We were cooking a chicken.

01:03:27.643 --> 01:03:29.050
Finally, we tried.

01:03:29.106 --> 01:03:32.053
Yes, to roast a chicken. I wasn't expecting that.

01:03:32.175 --> 01:03:34.065
It was so cute and natural.

01:03:34.643 --> 01:03:35.534
Very romantic.

01:03:36.347 --> 01:03:38.206
And that's when he went down on one knee.

01:03:39.744 --> 01:03:44.048
A marriage proposal that was ultimately quite ordinary for a prince like Harry.

01:03:46.108 --> 01:03:51.396
Obviously, this way of telling the story makes us think, "Oh, but actually, they're so simple, so like us."

01:03:51.458 --> 01:04:00.917
We think Harry is a normal prince, but to propose in front of a roast chicken, like that on a Sunday evening at Kensington Palace, it's true that it's a little less dreamy, we're a little disappointed by his marriage proposal.

01:04:01.380 --> 01:04:07.851
On the other hand, the engagement ring that Prince Harry gave to Meghan is unique and priceless for several reasons.

01:04:11.811 --> 01:04:14.065
The main stone comes from Botswana.

01:04:14.850 --> 01:04:18.064
and the small diamonds around it come from my mother's jewelry collection.

01:04:19.088 --> 01:04:22.169
To make sure she accompanies us on this incredible adventure.

01:04:23.471 --> 01:04:28.376
Obviously, Harry also wanted to involve his mother in this very important moment of his life.

01:04:29.181 --> 01:04:36.183
The two smaller stones that encircle this large diamond are stones that come from a brooch that Lady Diana wore on her wedding day.

01:04:37.963 --> 01:04:41.650
Finally, Prince Harry insisted on designing the ring himself.

01:04:42.947 --> 01:04:45.969
It's magnificent and he drew it himself, it's amazing.

01:04:46.237 --> 01:04:51.450
I still think that when you're the royal family and you have gigantic emeralds, I find it petty.

01:04:52.853 --> 01:04:54.532
By agreeing to become a princess,

01:04:54.916 --> 01:05:00.918
Meghan must first give up her old life, starting with her acting career, which she spent years building.

01:05:02.204 --> 01:05:07.204
She has clearly ended her contract with the series that made her famous, Suits.

01:05:07.391 --> 01:05:10.144
She was an actress, and overnight she could no longer be one.

01:05:11.469 --> 01:05:17.373
Even more difficult, for a woman of character like Meghan Markle, she must also sacrifice her freedom of expression.

01:05:20.155 --> 01:05:26.864
Meghan Markle will never be able to vote, will never be able to speak publicly on politics, religion, or money matters.

01:05:27.824 --> 01:05:33.227
She can no longer have a blog, no social media, no Facebook account, all of that has been deleted.

01:05:33.231 --> 01:05:35.108
The royal family does not have the right.

01:05:35.148 --> 01:05:40.732
She cleared the decks in order to take on the new role she will have within the royal family.

01:05:42.594 --> 01:05:45.324
Meghan Markle, a Catholic, had to convert.

01:05:45.860 --> 01:05:49.641
She was baptized on March 6th in a secret ceremony.

01:05:51.563 --> 01:05:58.428
To join the ranks of the Windsors, one must necessarily be of the Anglican religion, since Elizabeth II is the head of the Anglican Church.

01:06:01.168 --> 01:06:06.999
These were radical changes that Meghan accepted willingly and out of love, as she recently revealed in an interview.

01:06:09.659 --> 01:06:12.664
I don't see these as renunciations, but simply as changes.

01:06:12.850 --> 01:06:14.101
This is a new challenge.

01:06:14.612 --> 01:06:16.112
A new chapter begins.

01:06:16.831 --> 01:06:25.452
Even having managed to overcome everything in his life, his main challenge now... is to manage to comply with the rules of the most rigid royalty in the world.

01:06:26.956 --> 01:06:33.086
It's surely the most cumbersome monarchy there is today. It's a monarchy where you still have all those uniforms, you have the real crown on your head.

01:06:36.081 --> 01:06:38.034
It is a very strict monarchy in terms of rules.

01:06:38.716 --> 01:06:43.595
Whereas Harry, by birth, was raised with a protocol that he has mastered perfectly,

01:06:43.956 --> 01:06:51.151
Meghan, for her part, must flawlessly apply the codes and requirements of the British aristocracy, a world that is completely unknown to her.

01:06:53.411 --> 01:06:55.972
The protocol is something difficult to learn.

01:06:56.070 --> 01:06:59.975
A future member of the royal family doesn't take selfies with the crowd.

01:07:01.094 --> 01:07:03.223
does not give autographs,

01:07:04.063 --> 01:07:06.991
She always wears a pair of tights under her skirts.

01:07:08.093 --> 01:07:11.027
Very short dresses and plunging necklines are a thing of the past.

01:07:11.509 --> 01:07:15.484
Old-fashioned European educational rules, absurd and outdated for an American.

01:07:16.138 --> 01:07:17.348
And yet...

01:07:18.023 --> 01:07:22.349
A person who is to enter the royal family does not cross their legs but puts them side by side.

01:07:23.150 --> 01:07:28.953
She must always stand at least three steps behind the Queen, and she must curtsy to Elizabeth II.

01:07:30.653 --> 01:07:36.818
To be able to maintain her status, Meghan is constantly accompanied by a personal assistant who worked for Kate Middleton.

01:07:39.684 --> 01:07:46.917
This lady's role is now to teach Meghan everything that is and is not done in terms of royal protocol.

01:07:49.177 --> 01:07:52.961
Megan can also count on Harry's 33 years of experience.

01:07:54.823 --> 01:07:56.886
Prince Harry is also helping her.

01:07:56.945 --> 01:08:01.969
He said, laughing, that he makes diagrams for her so she can keep track of all the uncles, aunts, and cousins.

01:08:03.910 --> 01:08:06.738
That he accompany her in everything she needs to know.

01:08:08.976 --> 01:08:14.123
Despite all these efforts, the young American woman will make numerous missteps with each new public appearance.

01:08:15.719 --> 01:08:21.960
So, as a result, her reflex is to accept a selfie, an autograph, or even a hug from a fan who asks for it.

01:08:23.202 --> 01:08:26.466
But all of that is strictly forbidden by the British royal family.

01:08:27.225 --> 01:08:32.250
Never, ever has Kate Middleton broken protocol to this extent.

01:08:33.146 --> 01:08:34.083
It's different.

01:08:38.926 --> 01:08:41.749
It's a change from the usual monarchical rigidity.

01:08:42.162 --> 01:08:43.358
Well, why not?

01:08:44.568 --> 01:08:47.368
People clearly like it.

01:08:47.689 --> 01:08:51.575
Protocol blunders that could well become Meghan Markle's trademark.

01:08:54.154 --> 01:08:57.902
She must, of course, be a worthy representative of the Windsor family.

01:08:58.321 --> 01:09:01.295
But alongside that, she must not forget what she once was.

01:09:01.390 --> 01:09:04.447
And then, she also needs to clearly distinguish herself from Kate from the very beginning.

01:09:06.872 --> 01:09:11.014
Although they love them, the British demand exemplary behavior from their prince.

01:09:11.192 --> 01:09:21.826
Meghan Markle is joining a family where, 365 days a year, 24 hours a day, even on vacation, all over the world and for her entire life, she will be scrutinized and spied on.

01:09:21.947 --> 01:09:24.072
And nothing will ever be spared him again.

01:09:26.688 --> 01:09:31.733
I think she must be super in love, because to follow all those rules, it must be complicated on a daily basis.

01:09:32.350 --> 01:09:36.834
You need to have a lot of character, and above all, quite a bit of courage.

01:09:39.203 --> 01:09:44.387
Of course, there is the palace life, the luxury, the castles, the beautiful dresses and the parties.

01:09:44.546 --> 01:09:47.968
But by marrying a prince, Meghan will also have duties.

01:09:48.984 --> 01:09:53.918
It will also be a difficult life, where one will have to attend to obligations that are sometimes very heavy.

01:09:55.108 --> 01:09:58.211
We have to hold social events constantly.

01:09:59.373 --> 01:10:02.577
We should look at people and be interested in their problems, even though we might not care about them.

01:10:03.779 --> 01:10:06.262
Meghan will also have to bear the weight of the crown.

01:10:07.483 --> 01:10:12.529
We are with a man who doesn't do what he wants, and therefore we are the wife of someone who doesn't do what he wants, so we don't do what we want.

01:10:12.685 --> 01:10:20.369
It's something that truly is a deprivation of liberty that few young women can tolerate. The label is truly akin to a prison.

01:10:22.091 --> 01:10:28.469
In return, Meghan Markle gains media visibility that she would never have had access to before meeting Harry.

01:10:30.970 --> 01:10:36.250
She will be much better known through her marriage to Prince Harry than through her series Suits, and her Instagram account.

01:10:37.850 --> 01:10:50.656
And she also has enough consistency to say to herself, okay, I'm going to have a new life, I'm going to use this extraordinary platform that is the royal family, to change things, to change the world, which has been her true desire since her earliest childhood.

01:10:51.975 --> 01:10:59.022
She can tell herself that I am still contributing to the modernization of this family, namely the marriage between a prince and a mixed-race person.

01:11:00.868 --> 01:11:01.703
Harry and Meghan,

01:11:02.149 --> 01:11:05.713
It is the story of a true story, that of the prince and the shepherdess.

01:11:06.689 --> 01:11:11.599
But will they manage to eclipse the star couple of the royal family, Kate and William?

01:11:18.734 --> 01:11:25.361
On Monday, April 23, following the same ceremony and for centuries, Buckingham Palace announced the birth of a prince of England.

01:11:26.359 --> 01:11:30.065
Framed, an official statement is presented to the public on a gilded easel.

01:11:32.945 --> 01:11:41.458
It was only after the announcement made by the Queen's office that William was able to visit his two children, George and Charlotte, with their new little brother, Louis.

01:11:45.497 --> 01:11:48.326
An hour later, and in front of cameras from all over the world,

01:11:48.412 --> 01:11:54.280
The Duke and Duchess of Cambridge finally presented their third child, Louis, to an expected crowd.

01:11:55.476 --> 01:12:03.471
With the day of hospitalization costing British taxpayers 7000 euros, to everyone's surprise, Kate only stayed at the clinic for 7 hours for her delivery.

01:12:05.101 --> 01:12:10.014
And as usual, she appeared impeccably groomed and made up, as if nothing had happened.

01:12:13.401 --> 01:12:18.186
Very happy, delighted, thank you. Three, three times more worried now.

01:12:19.648 --> 01:12:23.091
Kate and William have always projected the image of a perfect couple.

01:12:23.690 --> 01:12:25.492
They are young, they are beautiful.

01:12:26.015 --> 01:12:29.277
Their first two children, George and Charlotte, are already stars.

01:12:31.261 --> 01:12:33.843
Charlotte, Charlotte, come and pet the dog.

01:12:37.065 --> 01:12:39.971
Kate and William's life is like a fairy tale.

01:12:40.913 --> 01:12:42.068
And yet...

01:12:43.519 --> 01:12:48.514
It makes for a rather bland couple. It makes for a rather boring couple, "boring" as the English say.

01:12:49.076 --> 01:12:50.657
Yes, it's too "goody-goody".

01:12:51.306 --> 01:12:54.660
How am I going to translate "goody-goody"? It's too much of a model of virtue.

01:12:57.045 --> 01:13:00.147
She's always smiling. I would have said it's perfect for the queen.

01:13:00.784 --> 01:13:03.076
But it can annoy people after a while.

01:13:03.154 --> 01:13:04.654
They don't want to be interesting.

01:13:04.684 --> 01:13:09.709
They want to live their lives and take on the task that will be theirs when the time comes.

01:13:12.451 --> 01:13:17.015
Behind the forced smiles, it's even whispered that while William is doing the bare minimum,

01:13:17.515 --> 01:13:22.259
The truth is, he dreads the day when he will have to lead the same life as his grandmother, the queen.

01:13:24.599 --> 01:13:27.245
The Queen, on January 1st of each year,

01:13:28.349 --> 01:13:33.873
knows that she will be on her schedule until December 31st of the year, quarter hour by quarter hour.

01:13:34.771 --> 01:13:39.676
That is to say, she doesn't have a day to herself to do nothing, to dream, everything is codified.

01:13:39.911 --> 01:13:40.698
It's hell.

01:13:41.113 --> 01:13:43.443
Does William really want to be king?

01:13:45.100 --> 01:13:51.087
William is ready to be king. Would he want to be? We cannot decide, but he has been prepared for this role.

01:13:51.765 --> 01:13:55.671
None of the members of the royal family wished to be members of the royal family.

01:13:56.054 --> 01:13:59.273
None of the members of the royal family envy being king.

01:14:00.373 --> 01:14:05.602
It is said that he did not want to be, except that he has no choice, just as Prince Charles has no choice either.

01:14:07.335 --> 01:14:10.699
William is not yet ready to take on such a demanding role.

01:14:12.899 --> 01:14:18.712
It is an immense violence against an individual to be unable to express a single opinion throughout their life.

01:14:19.511 --> 01:14:23.943
You are expected to embody an ethic, a philosophy,

01:14:25.283 --> 01:14:26.425
that you give an example.

01:14:30.220 --> 01:14:36.868
Behind the scenes, what keeps Prince William going is the unwavering support of Kate, who always stands by his side.

01:14:38.430 --> 01:14:40.046
"She is my balance," he said.

01:14:40.390 --> 01:14:47.737
"She is the person who will make me a good king one day," he recently declared in the pages of an English magazine.

01:14:50.120 --> 01:14:52.055
Kate is perfect too.

01:14:52.500 --> 01:14:56.019
On every occasion, she proves herself worthy of the royal family.

01:14:57.351 --> 01:15:02.837
It is a blessing for the royal family to have found a young girl who loves so much, who takes on this responsibility with such pleasure.

01:15:03.318 --> 01:15:07.558
I would even go further, there is an English expression, we say "she does the job", she does the job.

01:15:07.940 --> 01:15:11.323
And above all, she never makes any protocol blunders.

01:15:13.246 --> 01:15:19.331
She didn't make a mistake; it's very difficult, it requires constant attention to reach that level of perfection.

01:15:20.979 --> 01:15:24.879
For her, it's natural. That, I think, is the key to her success.

01:15:26.467 --> 01:15:28.009
It must be said that, unlike Diana,

01:15:28.347 --> 01:15:31.591
Kate has been conditioned her whole life to become a princess.

01:15:33.707 --> 01:15:40.267
Kate was prepared for a very long time. They wanted to test her willpower, their determination, her moral strength.

01:15:41.828 --> 01:15:46.859
It's not for nothing that the English press nicknamed Kate Middleton "Waity Katie", meaning the one who waits.

01:15:47.118 --> 01:15:52.634
She fell in love with William when she was 20, and it took her 10 years to marry him, so I think she understood the role.

01:15:53.944 --> 01:15:55.765
"The task ahead of me is very daunting,

01:15:56.786 --> 01:15:58.909
But I'm taking it all in stride.

01:15:59.711 --> 01:16:01.929
William is a very good teacher, he helps me a lot.

01:16:03.070 --> 01:16:05.916
And I'm looking forward to spending even more time with him."

01:16:07.618 --> 01:16:08.975
"She really knows how to flatter me."

01:16:10.542 --> 01:16:14.891
With Kate, the monarchy gains a model princess, who is also a fashion icon.

01:16:16.152 --> 01:16:18.592
All the magazines are vying to put her on the cover.

01:16:20.923 --> 01:16:23.345
Kate looks stunning, she has style.

01:16:23.864 --> 01:16:27.090
She has style, she has class, she is always elegant.

01:16:27.347 --> 01:16:29.808
She has a body that can carry anything, a bit like Diana back in the day.

01:16:30.036 --> 01:16:31.597
Kate is absolutely a fashion icon.

01:16:32.536 --> 01:16:34.341
Kate is a favorite with the press.

01:16:34.455 --> 01:16:35.760
but not only that.

01:16:37.005 --> 01:16:49.668
It should be noted that every dress, every blazer, every pair of shoes, whether they be ballet flats or stilettos worn by Kate Middleton, are snapped up the day after her appearance by young English women who really want to copy this style.

01:16:52.969 --> 01:16:56.976
The princess stimulates the British economy with each of her appearances.

01:16:59.117 --> 01:17:04.262
She manages to sell absolutely everything she touches, like few other women in the world.

01:17:05.663 --> 01:17:10.542
Her best-selling items, all her maternity dresses, and the outfit she wore for her engagement.

01:17:12.632 --> 01:17:18.685
She is wearing a blue dress, sold out; no more blue dresses of this type were available.

01:17:20.465 --> 01:17:24.347
An impeccable style, which sells, but lacks a bit of imagination.

01:17:25.003 --> 01:17:28.730
By trying so hard to please the queen, Kate is starting to resemble her.

01:17:30.503 --> 01:17:32.613
The queen is already very, very colorful.

01:17:32.780 --> 01:17:35.088
You need sunglasses to look at it.

01:17:35.176 --> 01:17:37.628
The colors the queen is wearing are indeed in very bad taste.

01:17:37.909 --> 01:17:40.832
And I think Kate is starting to slip into that same bad taste.

01:17:41.551 --> 01:17:43.332
And behind the glossy images,

01:17:44.065 --> 01:17:46.217
The princess is missing a bit of spice.

01:17:48.220 --> 01:17:49.820
Kate is not a pop princess at all.

01:17:50.001 --> 01:17:51.037
It is also,

01:17:51.682 --> 01:17:53.604
a very serious personality

01:17:55.170 --> 01:17:57.063
or even a little faded.

01:17:57.551 --> 01:18:02.257
Kate is someone who is, let's say, a bit like clockwork.

01:18:03.411 --> 01:18:10.942
Everyone needs to be able to project a certain idea of ​​England onto her, and the best way to achieve that is to avoid showing too strong a personality.

01:18:12.942 --> 01:18:18.372
Since the beginning of their relationship, Kate and William have made a flawless run at every major stage of their lives.

01:18:20.011 --> 01:18:21.211
They are perfect.

01:18:21.335 --> 01:18:25.880
William is the perfect future king. Apart from his hair loss, he's perfect.

01:18:25.960 --> 01:18:28.339
And with her, there's never a misstep.

01:18:30.140 --> 01:18:36.364
On April 29, 2011, the couple gave the British public the most exceptional wedding of all time.

01:18:37.515 --> 01:18:42.968
It's a breath of fresh air. It's the prince, the princess, the crown of England, the castle.

01:18:43.773 --> 01:18:46.997
The long train, the tiara, the diamonds, it's a dream.

01:18:47.795 --> 01:18:55.366
There were almost 3 billion viewers gathered in front of their screens. So it was a love story that was absolutely moving the entire world.

01:18:58.489 --> 01:19:00.922
All the ingredients for the perfect marriage are there.

01:19:02.318 --> 01:19:05.475
Famous guests included Elton John and the Beckham couple.

01:19:05.904 --> 01:19:08.693
A simple yet majestic decoration.

01:19:09.318 --> 01:19:11.318
A bride and groom radiating happiness.

01:19:11.684 --> 01:19:14.990
William and Kate represent a sincere love, a true love.

01:19:16.333 --> 01:19:17.314
They chose each other.

01:19:17.372 --> 01:19:20.458
They brought a breath of fresh air, let's be clear.

01:19:20.521 --> 01:19:23.240
They were both beautiful, it was very well done.

01:19:23.927 --> 01:19:28.508
By joining the Windsor dynasty, Kate, the commoner, is realizing her dream.

01:19:30.780 --> 01:19:34.581
Catherine Elisabeth, do you want to take this man as your husband?

01:19:34.641 --> 01:19:35.604
Yes, I want it.

01:19:35.666 --> 01:19:42.690
Kate, all her life, prepared for the big day; in her fantasies, in her head, that's what she wanted.

01:19:45.231 --> 01:19:50.667
She knows it, her dress makes people forget the one Diana wore at her wedding in 1981.

01:19:52.287 --> 01:19:56.503
It's a white dress with lots of lace, it clings to her skin, it's by Alexander McQueen.

01:19:57.302 --> 01:19:59.832
The dress was amazing, the train was absolutely gorgeous.

01:20:00.823 --> 01:20:03.724
Kate had planned everything for a grand arrival.

01:20:04.265 --> 01:20:06.044
With one small exception.

01:20:06.306 --> 01:20:11.543
The overly perfect bride is going to have the spotlight stolen by her sister and her white sheath dress.

01:20:13.484 --> 01:20:17.219
First of all, it's not Kate who's putting on the show, it's her sister.

01:20:17.264 --> 01:20:20.787
When you see Pipa in her dress, streamlined like a fighter jet,

01:20:21.603 --> 01:20:24.324
I must say that all the networks in the world were surprised.

01:20:26.243 --> 01:20:32.171
David Lowe, a television commentator, immediately sensed that Pipa and her swayback would capture all the media attention.

01:20:33.852 --> 01:20:36.574
I was the first person in the world to talk about Pipa's buttocks.

01:20:37.038 --> 01:20:38.811
I was told to be quiet through my earpiece.

01:20:39.443 --> 01:20:41.532
that one shouldn't talk about things like that.

01:20:41.975 --> 01:20:45.171
Pipa's hip-swaying will make the front page of all the newspapers.

01:20:47.270 --> 01:20:52.001
I was congratulated because we got the whole world talking about Pipa's buttocks, which were sexier anyway.

01:20:53.131 --> 01:20:54.662
There was a slight movement of the hips.

01:20:55.725 --> 01:20:58.412
Kate will find solace on the balcony of Buckingham Palace.

01:20:59.028 --> 01:21:01.430
The princely couple offers their subjects not a,

01:21:02.152 --> 01:21:04.852
But two kisses, a sign of his sincere love.

01:21:07.176 --> 01:21:11.018
I told the people who were on set, you'll see, he's going to kiss her again.

01:21:11.239 --> 01:21:15.239
And sure enough, in the next second they kissed a second time.

01:21:19.949 --> 01:21:21.216
I found it incredibly charming.

01:21:23.232 --> 01:21:24.873
After the perfect wedding,

01:21:24.935 --> 01:21:27.630
three births, two boys and one girl.

01:21:27.967 --> 01:21:30.492
With the king's choice, the future of the crown is assured.

01:21:32.051 --> 01:21:34.112
They had the children when it was necessary.

01:21:34.395 --> 01:21:39.279
The heir has been born, he is even a little boy, so there will not even be a conflict over whether there will be a king or a queen.

01:21:41.063 --> 01:21:43.878
Everything fits perfectly within the frame, within the mold.

01:21:44.520 --> 01:21:46.618
Children already resembling their parents,

01:21:47.442 --> 01:21:50.457
well-dressed, well-behaved and always smiling.

01:21:52.192 --> 01:21:56.693
They are very attentive to the proper education of their children, to the fact that they must be,

01:21:57.779 --> 01:22:00.443
Definitely not spoiled or arrogant,

01:22:01.562 --> 01:22:05.731
which could happen quite quickly given their notoriety and privileges.

01:22:07.266 --> 01:22:12.774
William and Kate prefer evenings with their families by the fire to protocol obligations.

01:22:13.820 --> 01:22:22.448
William and Kate spend a lot of time with their family. They enjoy eating pizza in front of the television, like many people do. It's a fairly ordinary family life.

01:22:22.541 --> 01:22:26.944
It doesn't look very exciting, but at the same time, I think they have the life of old young people.

01:22:27.007 --> 01:22:30.851
They are 35 years old, have 3 children, and seem very happy.

01:22:30.911 --> 01:22:36.355
In their private lives, they primarily want peace, a happiness, in quotes, like everyone else.

01:22:36.515 --> 01:22:40.237
They invented a new style, which was monarchical simplicity.

01:22:41.945 --> 01:22:49.555
An ordinary daily life that greatly annoys the media, who are absolutely determined to find flaws in this couple, who seem so perfect in all circumstances.

01:22:52.289 --> 01:22:57.656
The press is on the lookout for any small misstep in order to create a soap opera around this couple.

01:23:00.056 --> 01:23:04.898
Kate Middleton is going to give a French newspaper its scoop of the year 2012.

01:23:06.479 --> 01:23:11.561
She had been photographed with a telephoto lens, topless, while she was resting on private property.

01:23:13.354 --> 01:23:14.791
The photo is going viral.

01:23:15.229 --> 01:23:18.270
The couple sued the newspaper and won their case.

01:23:19.510 --> 01:23:22.330
The French magazine was fined 45,000 euros.

01:23:23.292 --> 01:23:25.174
And there you have it, it certainly makes an impression.

01:23:27.055 --> 01:23:32.125
Since then, the press has been content to criticize Kate for her thinness and to question strange cuts on her hands.

01:23:35.425 --> 01:23:39.007
When the press noted that Kate Middleton regularly had bandages on her fingers,

01:23:40.768 --> 01:23:42.713
She began to wonder if she might not be...

01:23:43.425 --> 01:23:45.189
as Diana might have been, bulimic.

01:23:45.535 --> 01:23:50.719
Because to make yourself vomit, you put your fingers at the back of your throat, and isn't that what hurt her?

01:23:51.583 --> 01:23:58.450
That's all it takes for journalists to conclude that Kate is just as unhappy as Diana and suffers from the same eating disorders.

01:23:59.690 --> 01:24:02.774
As for William, there's nothing particularly juicy to report.

01:24:03.557 --> 01:24:08.557
The worst thing the prince is criticized for is not being involved enough in the affairs of the crown.

01:24:11.838 --> 01:24:14.758
Moreover, he has been heavily criticized for his lack of appearances.

01:24:15.261 --> 01:24:17.180
People said that William was a little bit lazy.

01:24:18.136 --> 01:24:20.167
Hello, pleased to meet you.

01:24:20.874 --> 01:24:21.875
Delighted.

01:24:22.229 --> 01:24:28.373
Since becoming a father, William only fulfills about a hundred official duties, whereas his grandmother fulfills more than 300.

01:24:30.729 --> 01:24:40.303
It was found that he didn't have enough engagements per year, which was honestly true. He had far fewer than Prince Charles, far fewer than his grandparents, who are 91 and 95 years old respectively.

01:24:42.341 --> 01:24:45.582
The only stolen images of William date back to March 2017.

01:24:46.028 --> 01:24:49.705
The prince was filmed letting loose on the dance floor of a nightclub in Switzerland.

01:24:52.613 --> 01:24:55.399
We have these images of him dancing, partying.

01:24:55.957 --> 01:24:58.676
That's great, we really, really want to use them in the media.

01:24:59.261 --> 01:25:03.929
And even going so far as to start a story about "doesn't he get bored with Kate Middleton?"

01:25:05.069 --> 01:25:07.709
In the end, nothing too scandalous.

01:25:08.853 --> 01:25:12.572
What we see of them are the moments when they are particularly upright and strict.

01:25:13.172 --> 01:25:18.520
But we certainly hope that behind closed doors, they too know how to party and live the life of a couple in their thirties like any other.

01:25:20.064 --> 01:25:25.190
While the British people are fond of modern-day fairy tales, they also need escapades and scandals.

01:25:26.689 --> 01:25:31.676
One royal couple chases another, as long as they provide a spectacle concerning her gracious majesty.

01:25:36.582 --> 01:25:43.369
So, since the announcement of their engagement, Meghan and Harry have totally eclipsed the too-polished and too-perfect William and Kate.

01:25:45.050 --> 01:25:49.253
Kate and William, they are more reserved, more rigid, more boring all the same.

01:25:50.800 --> 01:25:52.644
Attention is now focused on

01:25:53.363 --> 01:25:56.442
Harry and Meghan because they are new, because they are the future.

01:25:57.757 --> 01:25:59.960
William and Kate, it's already a done deal.

01:26:00.261 --> 01:26:04.929
So this year, despite the birth of Kate's third child, it's going to be the year of Harry and Meghan.

01:26:07.529 --> 01:26:13.527
By their simplicity and relaxed manner, Meghan and Harry appear more modern and more fun, in a word, less boring.

01:26:14.997 --> 01:26:16.668
The public was just waiting for this.

01:26:18.981 --> 01:26:20.981
They are quite a scandalous couple.

01:26:23.216 --> 01:26:25.484
Very handsome, young, dynamic.

01:26:25.553 --> 01:26:30.298
We see them kissing with Harry, and so on. Everything we've never seen between Kate and William.

01:26:30.377 --> 01:26:32.433
They laugh, they hold hands.

01:26:32.438 --> 01:26:35.479
A breath of fresh air. That's what's attractive, I think, to people.

01:26:35.560 --> 01:26:39.506
Despite their different styles, both couples have every reason to get along.

01:26:39.565 --> 01:26:44.090
because William and Harry have been inseparable since their mother's death in '97.

01:26:45.420 --> 01:26:48.950
It is truly this tragedy that will unbreakably bind them together.

01:26:49.670 --> 01:26:54.585
It is said that they do not go a day without calling each other, sometimes even several times a day.

01:26:55.346 --> 01:26:57.806
William and Harry are extremely close, extremely in sync.

01:26:58.127 --> 01:27:00.826
William always protected his little brother and vice versa.

01:27:01.006 --> 01:27:03.131
I don't think there's any jealousy between them.

01:27:03.131 --> 01:27:08.649
There is no competition between them, but on the contrary, there is a strong sense of solidarity which is important for a monarchy.

01:27:10.451 --> 01:27:13.523
They were determined not to let a woman jeopardize their close relationship.

01:27:14.447 --> 01:27:16.213
I'm scaring you.

01:27:19.201 --> 01:27:23.164
And when William congratulates his brother on his marriage, naturally,

01:27:23.266 --> 01:27:25.343
He does it in a very ironic way.

01:27:25.747 --> 01:27:32.794
Personally, I hope this means he'll stay away from my fridge and stop stealing all my food, like he has for the past few years.

01:27:34.039 --> 01:27:38.504
To put an end to all rumors of rivalry or jealousy between their partners,

01:27:38.868 --> 01:27:40.743
The two brothers have a solution.

01:27:40.820 --> 01:27:42.445
all four of them make appearances.

01:27:44.305 --> 01:27:50.149
Kate, Harry and I are delighted to be here this morning, and to launch our first Royal Foundation forum with Meghan.

01:27:50.988 --> 01:27:53.491
The word is that the four of them get along well.

01:27:53.489 --> 01:27:56.471
They do a lot of things together, and very quickly at that.

01:27:56.716 --> 01:28:00.280
Kate was the first person who met Meghan from the family with William.

01:28:01.381 --> 01:28:04.856
They have great trust in each other, this whole little quartet.

01:28:05.951 --> 01:28:08.514
A royal quartet that already has a nickname,

01:28:08.872 --> 01:28:12.231
the "Fab Four", in reference to the nickname the four Beatles had.

01:28:13.185 --> 01:28:16.982
The two couples have also chosen to share the immense Kensington Palace.

01:28:17.966 --> 01:28:23.214
Obviously, Diana's residence, therefore, is linked to childhood memories for Harry and William.

01:28:24.653 --> 01:28:26.455
to many things that mattered to them.

01:28:26.891 --> 01:28:31.697
And besides, they like being together, so Kate, William, Harry and Meghan will be neighbors.

01:28:32.478 --> 01:28:38.603
It is in this place steeped in family history that Harry and Meghan will write their future, with or without children.

01:28:39.587 --> 01:28:43.465
Meghan is not like Kate, bound by the duty to provide heirs to the monarchy.

01:28:45.945 --> 01:28:51.927
The Crown already has George and Charlotte, so they have virtually no institutional need to have children.

01:28:52.014 --> 01:28:53.728
So they can do whatever they want.

01:28:54.757 --> 01:28:57.015
But the question on everyone's mind is:

01:28:57.836 --> 01:29:03.181
Will Meghan be able to handle the pressure? And will Harry be the faithful husband she imagines?

01:29:04.680 --> 01:29:07.085
Meghan is a mix of Diana and Kate together.

01:29:07.523 --> 01:29:09.874
So it's possible that it will go very, very well.

01:29:10.333 --> 01:29:13.457
Or it's possible that things might go a little less well.

01:29:14.096 --> 01:29:16.338
The life of a princess means being cheated on pretty quickly.

01:29:16.519 --> 01:29:19.241
Because Harry was a big womanizer until not long ago.

01:29:20.346 --> 01:29:22.764
And Meghan, she's not going to tolerate him cheating on her.

01:29:24.604 --> 01:29:27.863
Already, some observers are betting on the failure of their union.

01:29:29.540 --> 01:29:31.881
They seem too different to get along well.

01:29:31.902 --> 01:29:35.126
Perhaps it's the magic of the encounter, I don't know.

01:29:36.850 --> 01:29:38.645
But if it holds up, it'll be fun.

01:29:39.712 --> 01:29:43.832
Time will tell if this marriage is as solid as it seems.

01:29:44.770 --> 01:29:50.756
Meanwhile, Diana's two sons have found happiness under the watchful eye of their grandmother, Elisabeth.

01:29:53.537 --> 01:29:56.108
The Queen is very encouraging towards her grandsons' campaigns.

01:29:57.006 --> 01:29:58.145
She is protective.

01:29:58.444 --> 01:30:10.391
She believes it's important that they have time to build a very strong family unit. Therefore, she wisely welcomes these stepdaughters with great kindness and creates the conditions for their success.

01:30:15.161 --> 01:30:19.295
The only downside is that a new battle could break out between the couples.

01:30:19.551 --> 01:30:21.676
Which one will be the most popular?

01:30:23.703 --> 01:30:25.125
If Harry and Meghan ever...

01:30:26.131 --> 01:30:29.308
who are, nevertheless, cooler, warmer, and more approachable in appearance,

01:30:30.050 --> 01:30:32.530
attract more people and more press,

01:30:34.490 --> 01:30:39.246
Well, it could still become a bit of a problem for the royalty after a while.

01:30:41.026 --> 01:30:43.477
Today, the match is already over.

01:30:43.529 --> 01:30:47.265
Meghan and Harry win the prize for glamour, naturalness and simplicity.

01:30:47.873 --> 01:30:53.099
A stance that will go with the uprightness and spotless perfection displayed by the couple William and Kate.

01:30:55.380 --> 01:30:58.370
I trust Kate and William to strategically,

01:31:01.915 --> 01:31:05.526
choose a few events that will make people talk about them.

01:31:06.725 --> 01:31:12.344
And I also trust Harry and Meghan to step down when the time is right.

01:31:15.807 --> 01:31:17.378
Everything is calculated.

01:31:17.452 --> 01:31:19.566
Life is a long journey.

01:31:20.256 --> 01:31:23.578
And I think that in the end, the winners will still be Kate and William.

01:31:25.100 --> 01:31:26.121
Kate and William,

01:31:26.823 --> 01:31:27.742
Meghan and Harry,

01:31:28.307 --> 01:31:29.783
or the story of a fairy tale.

01:31:30.565 --> 01:31:36.313
A story where two little girls from the common people fell in love with young and handsome orphaned princes.

01:31:37.432 --> 01:31:39.338
But let us hope that, as in fairy tales,

01:31:40.001 --> 01:31:41.318
They loved each other,

01:31:41.511 --> 01:31:43.444
They lived happily ever after and had many children.

